From: tbm00 <89701900+tbm00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Nov 2025 17:42:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Mace limiter

This patch intends to prevent multi-hit mace smash abuse by enforcing a per-player cooldown between smash hits and capping bonus fall-damage per strike. This minimizes hacked clients triggering multiple full-damage mace hits in the same tick, instantly killing players despite totems. Uses new configurable options in purpur.yml for enabling the limiter, setting minimum ticks between smash hits, and defining the maximum smash bonus damage per hit.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/item/MaceItem.java b/net/minecraft/world/item/MaceItem.java
